WEBVTT

00:00:28.613 --> 00:00:30.130
Jer mi je to posao.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.340
Jedan sam od vrlo malenog broja onih ljudi

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.454
koji se jako uzrujaju

00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:37.048
zbog lošeg razmaka među slovima T i E

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:38.948
kakav vidite ovdje.

00:00:38.948 --> 00:00:40.390
Moram skloniti ovaj slajd.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.461
Jer ga ne mogu gledati. Kao ni Chris.

00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:44.122
Evo, sad je dobro.

00:00:44.122 --> 00:00:45.890
Dakle, u mojem govoru radi se o povezanosti

00:00:45.890 --> 00:00:49.290
tehnologije i oblikovanja pisama.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:51.953
Tehnologija se promijenila

00:00:51.953 --> 00:00:54.825
nekoliko puta otkad sam počeo raditi:

00:00:54.825 --> 00:00:59.486
foto, digitalija, stolna računala, zasloni, web.

00:00:59.486 --> 00:01:01.224
Morao sam preživjeti te promjene i pokušati